# title: Discount certificate
# category: Structured notes
# underlyings: 1
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: The stock bought at a discount, with the upside capped: long the stock, short a call.
# param: notional = 1000 | amount | Notional of stock at the initial level
# param: cap = 1.05 | percent | Cap, % of the initial level
#
# The discount is the price of the call sold, visible in the present value.

2027-01-04
    notional = 1000
    cap = 1.05
    s0 = spot()

2028-01-04
    pays notional * min(spot() / s0, cap)
